GIF and screenshot files for the public community repo go here.

Git does not track empty directories, so this placeholder keeps the folder in the repo until the
first clip lands. Delete it once media/ has real files.

Names both READMEs expect (shot-by-shot script: ../../demo-script.md):
  demo-main.gif          hero, embedded at the top of both READMEs
  demo-operators.gif     ciw / d2w / gUiw / >ap
  demo-ex.gif            :1,5sort / :%s/foo/bar/g
  demo-textobjects.gif   di( / ci" / /function / *
  demo-preview.gif       preview on vs off, plus Escape restoring the view
